    "description": "<p>Lunars are not who they seem. The target of this Charm suffers an Illusion effect, believing the Lunar to be a nearby person and vice versa unless the target's reflexive (Perception + Awareness) roll beats a difficulty equal to the Lunar's Manipulation score. Spending one Willpower point allows the target to tell who is who for one action. After the target has spent three Willpower, the effect ends.</p>",
